        "message": "Skip Xvfb under GPU headless rendering; retain first GPU trial evidence\n\nThe first GPU-rendering trial aborted when Xvfb segfaulted in\nInitExtensions: the pod-wide NVIDIA graphics libraries injected with the\nGPU allocation interpose its GLX extension initialization. EGL headless\nrendering needs no X server, so the GPU profile no longer launches Xvfb\nor sets DISPLAY; the non-GPU software-rendering profile is unchanged.\nThe failed trial's evidence is retained (console-server preflight passed,\nrender context initialized without llvmpipe, Xvfb crash captured in\ndisplay.log) and documents the mechanism."
      },
      "type": "Git"
    },
